{
 "id": 177817,
 "name": "No Build Community Group",
 "is_closed": false,
 "creation-date": "2026-06-21",
 "description": "<p>A group for those interested in exploring a future of the web that requires fewer/no dependencies and fewer/no build steps. It will provide a forum to discuss what features of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript will lead to a better experience for those developers that value simplicity and eschew over-engineering. The mission of this group to push for web standards that will lead to a better experience for developers that create websites with either no build tools or minimal build tools.</p>\n\n<p>This group will not publish Specifications.</p>",
